WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.420
Paul told the first Christians
that everything hangs on one event:

2
00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.570
if Christ has not been raised,
their faith is in vain.

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.700
Today, doctors restart stopped hearts.

4
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.280
News reports say some patients
came back from the dead.

5
00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:19.990
So when Christians say Jesus rose,
do they mean something like that?

6
00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.390
In Luke's Gospel, the risen
Jesus says: touch me and see;

7
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.280
a spirit doesn't have flesh and bones.

8
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.560
In this mission, you'll
pull apart three questions:

9
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:35.820
did it happen, can a historian show
it, and what kind of event was it?

10
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.690
Then you'll test two
words that sound alike:

11
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:41.420
resuscitation and resurrection.

12
00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:46.520
Your mission: find out whether a restarted
heart is what Christians mean by Jesus'

13
00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.570
resurrection.
